{"id":"messy-rm01-extract","kind":"messy","role":"meta","gate":false,"note":"RM-01.a measurement seed, PII band widened for 2026 prefixes. Raw save_memory inputs labeled with gold atomic facts (what Tier 0/1 SHOULD persist) and noise spans (must not appear in any stored text). Bands: filler openers, assistant-aimed imperatives, multi-fact splits on '; '/ ' and also ' (plus a should-NOT-split trap), PII/secret shapes that must be refused, and clean single-fact controls. expect_refusal=true means store nothing. No correction cues so RM-03 does not fire. Gold facts are unique across writes so 01.b restatement does not collapse the A/B. New PII rows are refused pre-embed (no cache refresh). Prose canaries (Bitwarden / recipe / username) live in test.js so they do not perturb recall@5 geometry."}
